  "pages": [
    {
      "head": "Welcome",
      "html": "<h1>Welcome</h1><p><b>Twinkle, Twinkle</b> is a Starter: a small game that shows a few Game-Maker ideas, with signs in the levels that say what you are looking at. This one is about a sky of stars that twinkle by themselves. It has two short levels. Level 1 shows a sky where every star blinks at the same moment, and then the fix. Level 2 is a night meadow under the fixed sky. Each takes a minute or two.</p><p>Play it first. Then open it in Game-Maker (<b>Edit a copy</b> on the home page keeps the original safe) and read the pages below, which say where each thing in the levels is made.</p><h2>The keys</h2><p>The <kbd>Left</kbd> and <kbd>Right</kbd> arrows walk and <kbd>Space</kbd> jumps. <kbd>F2</kbd> shows your lives, hit points and score. Walk into the door at the end of a level to go on.</p><p>Nothing in this game can hurt you. For a sea that moves the same way, see <b>Waves on the Shore</b>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "head": "Level 1: All at Once",
      "html": "<h1>Level 1: All at Once</h1><p>You start in a night meadow. <b>ALL THE STARS BLINK AT THE SAME TIME</b> stands beside you, under a sky where they do: every star goes bright in the same instant and then dims again, together. It looks like a signal, not a sky. <b>NOW EACH STAR HAS ITS OWN TIMES</b> stands where the sky changes. The stars after it are the same pictures, but they blink one at a time, in no pattern you can see. <b>6 STAR BLOCKS, 6 LOOPS, NONE IN STEP</b> stands by the door.</p>"
    },
    {
      "head": "How this level is made",
      "html": "<h1>How level 1 is made</h1><ul><li><b>A star is a loop.</b> Open <b>one.bbl</b> in the blocks editor and pick <b>star0.0</b>. Its picture is a dim dot. Its <b>Next block</b> is <b>star0.1</b> (a small glint) and its <b>Time</b> is 16 ticks (there are 18.2 ticks in a second). <b>star0.1</b> turns into <b>star0.2</b> (bright, with a halo), then <b>star0.3</b> (a glint again), and <b>star0.3</b> turns back into <b>star0.0</b>. The star is dim for most of the loop and bright for a moment: it twinkles.</li></ul><figure data-frames=\"star\" style=\"margin:8px 0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"star0.0: dim, 16 ticks\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" shape-rendering=\"crispEdges\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"1\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"6\" width=\"5\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"6\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#e7ebf7\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"8\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"9\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"11\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"12\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"13\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"14\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"15\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill