ght=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"6\" width=\"5\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"6\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#fffba2\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#ffe771\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"6\" width=\"13\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"7\" width=\"5\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"7\" width=\"2\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#ffe771\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"7\" width=\"13\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"8\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"9\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"11\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"12\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"13\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"14\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"15\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"16\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"17\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"18\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"19\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/></svg><div><small>star0.3: glint, 2 ticks</small></div></div></figure><ul><li><b>Why they blink together.</b> The game keeps one clock for each block number, not for each cell of the map. When <b>star0.0</b> turns into <b>star0.1</b>, every <b>star0.0</b> on the map turns in the same tick. The first sky uses six star blocks, <b>sync0.0</b> to <b>sync5.0</b>, that differ only in where the star sits in the block, and that all keep the same times. So the whole sky turns together.</li><li><b>The fix is more blocks.</b> The second sky uses six loops, <b>star0</b> to <b>star5</b>, with the same pictures but their own times. They go round in 23, 32, 21, 37, 29 and 17 ticks, so they never line up for long.</li></ul><figure data-frames=\"loops\" style=\"margin:8px 0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"star0: 23 ticks round\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" shape-rendering=\"crispEdges\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"1\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"3\" width=\"5\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"2\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#2c3882\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"3\" width=\"13\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"6\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#2c3882\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"4\" width=\"11\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"5\" width=\"3\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#2c3882\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#ffe771\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"5\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#2c3882\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"5\" width=\"11\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"6\" width=\"2\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"2\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#2c3882\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#ffe771\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"6\" width=\"2\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"6\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#ffe771\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"6\" width=\"2\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#2c3882\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"6\" width=\"10\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"7\" width=\"2\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#141c61\"/>